\title{Reinforcement learning from human feedback and proximal policy optimization}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{rlhf}
\tag{ppo}

\p{RLHF, short for reinforcement learning from human feedback, names a family
of alignment-training pipelines. One influential pipeline fits a supervised
policy, learns a reward model from comparisons, and then optimizes the policy
against that reward while limiting movement from a reference policy. This
section separates those pipeline choices from proximal policy optimization
(PPO), the optimization method used in its final stage.}

